  "info": {
    "description": "Generated from internal/\u003cdomain\u003e/\u003centity\u003e/\u003cverb\u003e.go by cmd/mcplspec. Every operation is an MCPL action: the panel, this API and MCP (POST /v1/mcp) run the same handler, permission check, audit entry and event. A staff change takes a reason, kept in the audit log with it.",
    "title": "Shippin actions",
    "version": "1"
  },
